OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloud
OL,6,Fthickening in the evening, with
OL,7,Foutbreaks of light rain or drizzle.
OL,8,FRain moving in during the early hours,
OL,9,Fbecoming widespread and persistent
OL,10,Ftowards dawn. Eastern coasts perhaps
OL,11,Fstaying a little drier. Mild.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FA wet start, with overnight
OL,14,Frain continuing and spreading to all
OL,15,Fparts. Rain only gradually easing from
OL,16,Fthe west through the afternoon and
OL,17,Fpersisting along eastern coasts until
OL,18,Fdark.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
