OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FFine
OL,6,Fday Thursday after a chilly start,
OL,7,Fbefore rain and stronger winds spread
OL,8,Feast overnight. Breezy Friday and
OL,9,FSaturday, with plenty of drier
OL,10,Fintervals, but also further outbreaks
OL,11,Fof rain.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
